# Story page: levelsdone
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Every Door Opened
---
Twenty-two places, twenty-two doors. {name} had slithered through every one of them, and bumped into roughly half.

The garden seemed smaller now and the world much bigger, which is what happens to anyone who leaves home, and is the reason so many people never do.

Yet the scales were still humming. The coil was not finished with {name}. It was not even close. I would have mentioned this sooner, but nobody asked, and I was afraid.
